  "description": "As the biggest nerd on campus, Leslie Glass’s chances of randomly hooking up with a cute hottie are dwindling daily. Desperate for love, she turns to online dating. She finds a guy who’s exactly her type, but “FWB?” “BDSM?” Those words in his bio mean nothing to her. Little does she know that her online pretty boy is none other than Jack Offerman, the talk of the campus. Plus, she doesn’t know that he…really likes getting pegged. Will Jack be the perfect person to guide Leslie through the confusing, but oddly alluring, world of BDSM?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
